            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to MATTHEW D. ROBERTS, the actual innocence exception applies only in extraordinary cases where a prisoner was convicted of a crime they did not commit, and should not be extended to situations where the prisoner is guilty of the crime of which they were convicted."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "30d35aea144900fe51befe194be16542ccdc64dcad0a0319907cc65ae814bddf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-30d35aea1449-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked whether there is a manifest injustice exception to the procedural default rule and whether the Government concedes there was injustice."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "30d35aea144900fe51befe194be16542ccdc64dcad0a0319907cc65ae814bddf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-30d35aea1449-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether there is a rule that prevents confessing error in the state."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "30d35aea144900fe51befe194be16542ccdc64dcad0a0319907cc65ae814bddf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-30d35aea1449-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice O'Connor questioned why there is not an inadequate assistance of counsel claim and why the court should not address it before other issues."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "30d35aea144900fe51befe194be16542ccdc64dcad0a0319907cc65ae814bddf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-30d35aea1449-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "A Justice asked whether counsel's performance was adequate in this case."
      }
    ],
